  "title": "Music v2.5 joins a healthier model catalog",
  "summary": "New music and community agents arrived alongside a healthier model catalog, a more capable computer shell, and a substantial round of reliability work.\n\nAdded `elevenlabs/music-v2.5` for 3–300-second music generation, with instrumental mode, reference audio, and composition-plan inpainting. Enter’s model catalog now shows healthy official models by default, displays health indicators, and lets users include other models with `status:all`. Model-list APIs use `status=all|healthy` and a renamed status header; the API docs were updated to match.\n\nCommunity contributors added CatGPT Comic, a crow shopkeeper that remembers requested facts across chats, and a chat game about persuading a reluctant elevator to descend. CatGPT’s existing selfie feature got a repaired image reference and a new preferred image model. The app catalog gained Pollen Craft, Moko, Comicstyles, Cogitor AI, and GitMuse; two more contributors gained community-model access.\n\nComputer MCP agents can work with a public collective-memory repository, and their commits default to the caller’s linked GitHub identity. The shell gained CSV processing, HTML-to-Markdown conversion, file identification, and more Git operations, including rebase and cherry-pick. A curl fix helps requests reach APIs that require a User-Agent, while the agent guide now explains the available MCP servers and computer-shell behavior.",
